OL,3,GNEWSACouncil may seek government help
OL,4,Ato plug #32m gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of York Council is forecasting a
OL,7,F#32.3m hole in its budget over the next
OL,8,Ftwo years and may need government help
OL,9,Fto balance the books.
OL,11,FA report from the Labour-run
OL,12,Fauthority's director of finance said
OL,13,Fthe council was facing "some of the
OL,14,Fmost significant financial challenges
OL,15,Fwe have ever experienced".
OL,17,FIt adds that without making the
OL,18,Fnecessary savings it "may" have to seek
OL,19,Fexceptional financial support "to avoid
OL,20,Fthe risk of a Section 114 notice",
OL,21,Fmeaning it would have to halt all
OL,22,F"non-essential" spending.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
