OL,3,GNEWSACouncil may seek government help
OL,4,Ato plug #32m gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Claire Douglas said:
OL,7,F"This is a very significant and a very
OL,8,Fserious situation that's been many
OL,9,Fyears in the making. We're getting on
OL,10,Fwith the job of dealing with it."
